window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>I was the dutiful daughter. Or at least that was what it looked like from the outside.<br> <br> Deep inside, I was suffocating. I longed for something I didn’t know how or where to find. But I kept my façade firmly in place while I searched for answers.<br> <br> Until one New Orleans night changed it all. <br> <br> Nikola Nikolaev—the heir to the Crescent City’s ruthless criminal empire—caught me in a club that was off-limits. And just like that, my carefully constructed world began to crumble.<br> <br> We never saw it coming. The invisible force between us, the one that had a power far beyond anything we understood, pulling us closer, demanding what we couldn’t give.<br> <br> But there was more to Nikola than the unhinged, reckless man everyone saw.<br> <br> I fell. Hard.<br> He didn’t.<br> <br> I should’ve walked away. Instead, I was determined to peel back his layers and prove to him he’d met his match.<br> <br> I, Skye Leone, would rise to become his queen.</p>"; 
